    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(d) either: (i) the Commission considers that it is unlikely that a final access determination in relation to access to the service will be made within 6 months after the commencement of the public inquiry; or (ii) the Commission considers that there is an urgent need to make an access determination in relation to access to the service before the completion of the public inquiry;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The public inquiry must end before the interim access determination can be made.";
