    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "must";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Must give an infringement notice if reasonable grounds exist";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "If an authorized infringement notice officer has reasonable grounds to believe a person has contravened a civil penalty provision, the authorized infringement notice officer may give to the person an infringement notice.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The authorized infringement notice officer must give an infringement notice to the person if he or she has reasonable grounds to believe that a person has contravened a civil penalty provision.";
